<<beastNEWinit 6 dolphin>>
<span class="red">짐승 무리: $enemyno 마리</span>
<br>
<<for _x = $enemyno-1; _x gte 0; _x-->>
짐승 <<print _x+1>> 소개: <span class="green">$NPCList[_x].description $NPCList[_x].type</span>
<br>
대명사: <span class="red">$NPCList[_x].pronoun</span> 성별: <span class="red">$NPCList[_x].gender</span>
<br>
성기 크기, 설명: <span class="gold">$NPCList[_x].penissize, <<= window.KR.getPenisDescKr($NPCList[_x].penisdesc)>></span> 가슴 크기, 설명: <span class="gold">$NPCList[_x].breastsize, <<= window.KR.getBreastSizeKr($NPCList[_x].breastsdesc)>></span>
<br>
성기 활성: <span class="gold">$NPCList[_x].penis</span> 질 활성: <span class="gold">$NPCList[_x].vagina</span>
<br><br>
<</for>>

<<link [[다음|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: NNPC Parade
<!-- Used to debug Named NPCs by displaying all attributes. -->
<span class="red">총 명명된 NPC: $NPCName.length</span>
<br>
<!-- Example of introduction, variable set / increment, and put away of npc -->
/% <<npc Robin>> %/
/% In walks $npc[0] and takes a bow. <<He>> has more Trauma now. And out <<he>> goes.<br> %/
/% <<npcset $npc[0] trauma 80>> %/
/% <<npcincr $npc[0] trauma 100>> %/
/% <<endnpc>> %/

<<set _genderColor to {"m": "blue", "h": "purple", "f": "pink"}>>

<<for _i = 0; _i lt $NPCName.length; _i++>>
	<<set _nnpc to $NPCName[_i]>>
	<<set _nnpc_init_backup to _nnpc.init>>
	<<npc _nnpc.nam>>
	<<set _listnpc to $NPCList[0]>>
	<br>
	명명된 NPC #<<print _i>>: <span class="green">_nnpc.nam, _nnpc.title</span>
	<br>
	<<set _pColor to _genderColor[_nnpc.pronoun]>>
	<<set _gColor to _genderColor[_nnpc.gender]>>
	대명사: <span @class="_pColor"><<print _nnpc.pronoun.toUpperCase()>></span> |
	성별: <span @class="_gColor"><<print _nnpc.gender.toUpperCase()>></span>
	<br>
	성기 크기: <span class="gold">_nnpc.penissize</span>, 설명: <span class="gold"><<= window.KR.getPenisDescKr(_nnpc.penisdesc)>></span>,
	상태: <span @class="_nnpc.penis is 'none' ? 'red' : 'gold'">_nnpc.penis</span>
	<br>
	가슴 크기: <span class="gold">_nnpc.breastsize</span>, 설명: <span class="gold"><<= window.KR.getBreastSizeKr(_nnpc.breastsdesc)>></span>
	<br>
	유형: <span class="blue"><<if _nnpc.adult>>성인<<elseif _nnpc.teen>>십대<<else>>???<</if>></span>
	| 불안감: <span class="red">_nnpc.insecurity</span>
	<br>
	신뢰: <span class="gold">_nnpc.trust</span>
	| 사랑 (<span class="pink"><<print setup.loveAlias[_nnpc.nam]()>></span>): <span class="gold">_nnpc.love</span>
	| 지배: <span class="gold">_nnpc.dom</span>
	| 욕정: <span class="gold">_nnpc.lust</span>
	| 분노: <span class="gold">_nnpc.rage</span>
	| 트라우마: <span class="gold">_nnpc.trauma</span>
	<br>
	상태: _nnpc.state
	<br>
	의상: <span class="teal">_nnpc.clothes.set</span>
	<br>
	상의: <span class="teal">_nnpc.clothes.upper.name</span> | 하의: <span class="teal">_nnpc.clothes.lower.name</span>
	<br>
	의상 세트: [<<print '<span class="teal">'+_nnpc.outfits.join('</span>, <span class="teal">')+"</span>">>]
	<br>

	당신은 <<if _nnpc_init_backup isnot 1>><span class="red">아직</span><</if>> <<him>>【와과】 만난 적이 없습니다.
	<br>
	<<endnpc _nnpc.nam>>
	<<set _nnpc.init to _nnpc_init_backup>>

	<hr>
<</for>>

<<link [[다음|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

