			<span class="red">당신은 <span class="wraith">상아의 원혼</span>에게 쫓기고 있습니다.</span>
		<<else>>
			<span class="red">당신은 <<print window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($npc[$npcrow.indexOf(0)])>>에게 쫓기고 있습니다.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		해당 NPC의 체육 스킬은 <span class="gold"><<print $NPCList[0].skills.athletics>></span>입니다.
		<br>
		해당 NPC의 보안 스킬은 <span class="gold"><<print $NPCList[0].skills.security>></span>입니다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $enemyno is 2>>
		<span class="teal"><<He>>【은는】 <<person2>><<person>> 한 명을 동반합니다.</span>
		<<person1>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $enemyno gte 3>>
		<<He>>【은는】
		<<switch $enemyno>>
			<<case 6>><span class="pink">다섯 </span>
			<<case 5>><span class="purple">네 </span>
			<<case 4>><span class="blue">세 </span>
			<<case 3>><span class="lblue">두 </span>
		<</switch>>
		명의 동료와 함께 나타납니다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $NPCList[0].fullDescription is "Ivory Wraith">>
		<span class="blue">원혼에게 동료 NPC를 추가할 수 없습니다.</span>
		<br>
		<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<switch $enemyno>>
			<<case 6>>
				<span class="blue">더 이상 NPC를 추가할 수 없습니다.</span>
				<br><br>
				<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<case 5>>
				<<link [[이름 없는 NPC 한 명 더 추가|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<generate6>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<case 4>>
				<<link [[이름 없는 NPC 한 명 더 추가|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<generate5>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<case 3>>
				<<link [[이름 없는 NPC 한 명 더 추가|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<generate4>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<case 2>>
				<<link [[이름 없는 NPC 한 명 더 추가|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<generate3>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<case 1>>
				<<link [[이름 없는 NPC 추가|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<generate2>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[테스트 시작|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $enemyno is 0>>
		이름 있는 NPC를 선택하세요.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[에이버리|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Avery">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[베일리|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Bailey">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[브라이어|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Briar">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[에덴|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Eden">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[하퍼|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Harper">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[카일라|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Kylar">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[레이튼|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Leighton">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[모건|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Morgan">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[휘트니|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Whitney">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[원혼|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to "Ivory Wraith">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[다른 사람|Named NPC Stalk Select]]>><<set $stalkTestNPC to either("Alex","Charlie","Darryl","Doren","Gwylan","Jordan","Landry","Mason","Niki","Quinn","Remy","River","Robin","Sam","Sirris","Sydney","Wren", "Zephyr")>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
