:: Hypnotist Test Sex
<<if $sexstart is 1 or $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<if $sexstart is 1>>
		<<set $sexstart to 0>>
		<<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>>
		<<neutral 1>>
	<<elseif $molestationstart is 1>>
		<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
		<<controlloss>>
		<<violence 1>>
		<<neutral 1>>
		<<molested>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $phase is "Harper">>
		<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
		의사 하퍼가 당신에게 다가온다. "의료 과실을 저지를 시간이군." <<he>>【이가】 말한다.
	<<else>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $NPCList[0].traits.pushUnique("hypnotist")>>
		<<person>> 한 명이 당신에게 걸어온다. "이봐," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "졸리다거나 뭐 그런 거겠지. 그냥 빨리 끝내자고."
	<</if>>
	<<maninit>><<enable_rescue>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].lefthand to "hypnosis">><<set $NPCList[0].lefttool to "pendant">>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>><<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 1>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[종료|Hypnotist Test Sex Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[체력|Hypnotist Test Sex Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[절정|Hypnotist Test Sex Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Hypnotist Test Sex]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[긴급 탈출|Hypnotist Test Sex Finish]]>><<set $finish to 1>><</link>>
<br><br><br><br>

:: Hypnotist Test Sex Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<He>>【은는】 고개를 끄덕이고는, 최면을 거는 듯 엉덩이를 흔들며 멀어진다.
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<He>>【은는】 얼굴을 찌푸린다. "이봐, 날 두들겨 패기만 할 거면 이걸 테스트하는 의미가 없잖아?"
<<elseif $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 1>>
	"용케 소리를 질렀군." <<he>>【이가】 중얼거린다. "앞으로는 그것도 바꿔야겠어."
<<else>>
	"이쯤에서 멈춰도 되겠군." <<he>>【이가】 말한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endcombat>>
<<clotheson>>
<<link [[다시 하기|Hypnotist Test]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[집으로 돌아간다|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: Hypnotist Test Tentacles
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<set $enemytype to "tentacles">>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<molested>>
	<<tentaclestart 8 15>>
	<<for _t to 0; _t lt $tentacles.max; _t++>>
		<<set $tentacles[_t].traits.pushUnique("hypno")>>
	<</for>>
	촉수 무리가 당신을 덮쳐온다. 일반적으로 최면 특성이 없는 촉수까지 포함해, 모든 촉수가 당신에게 최면을 걸 수 있다.
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectstentacles>>
<<tentacles>>
<<statetentacles>>
<<actionstentacles>>

<<if $tentacles.active lte ($tentacles.max / 2)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Hypnotist Test Tentacles Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Hypnotist Test Tentacles]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Hypnotist Test Tentacles Finish
<<effects>>

테스트를 마친 생물은 당신에게 흥미를 잃고 허공으로 사라진다.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[다시 하기|Hypnotist Test]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[집으로 돌아간다|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: Pregnancy Belly Test
여기서 배 크기를 늘리거나 줄일 수 있습니다.
아래의 나가기 링크 외 다른 방법으로 이 장면을 나가면 배 크기가 고정되니 주의하세요!
해결하려면 V.bellySizeDebug를 해제하세요.
<hr>
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $bellySizeDebug to playerBellySize()>>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<animateCombat>>
<hr>
<label class="no-numberify">
	<span class="lewd">몸:</span><br>
	<div class="small-description">
		<<link [[몸 돌리기|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $position to (V.position === "doggy" ? "missionary" : "doggy")>><</link>>
		<br>
		속도 변경:
		<<link [[정지|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $animDebug to false>><<set $enemyarousal to 0>><</link>> |
		<<link [[느리게|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $animDebug to true>><<set $enemyarousal to 0>><</link>> |
		<<link [[보통|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $animDebug to true>><<set $enemyarousal to 1 + ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 1>><</link>> |
		<<link [[빠르게|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $animDebug to true>><<set $enemyarousal to 1 + ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 3>><</link>> |
		<<link [[매우 빠르게|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $animDebug to true>><<set $enemyarousal to 1 + ($enemyarousalmax / 5) * 4>><</link>> |
	</div>
	<hr>
	<span class="lewd">배:</span><br>
	<div class="small-description">
		<<set $bellySizeDebug to Math.clamp($bellySizeDebug,0,24)>>
		<span class="blue">현재 배 크기: $bellySizeDebug</span>
		<<ind>>
		배 크기 증가:
		<<link [[1|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $bellySizeDebug++>><</link>> |
		<<link [[5|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $bellySizeDebug += 5>><</link>> |
		<<link [[10|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $bellySizeDebug += 10>><</link>> |
		<<ind>>
		배 크기 감소:
		<<link [[1|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $bellySizeDebug-->><</link>> |
		<<link [[5|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $bellySizeDebug -= 5>><</link>> |
		<<link [[10|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $bellySizeDebug -= 10>><</link>> |
		<<ind>>
		설명:
		<<bellyDescription "pc" true>>
	</div>
	<hr>
	<span class="green">의류:</span><br>
	<div class="small-description">
		벗기:
		<<link [[모두 벗기|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<strip>><</link>> |
		<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked">><<link [[상의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<upperstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked">><<link [[속상의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<underupperstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.lower.name isnot "naked">><<link [[하의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<lowerstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">><<link [[속하의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<underlowerstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.head.name isnot "naked">><<link [[머리|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<headstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.face.name isnot "naked">><<link [[얼굴|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<facestrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.hands.name isnot "naked">><<link [[손|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<handsstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.legs.name isnot "naked">><<link [[다리|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<legsstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.feet.name isnot "naked">><<link [[발|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<feetstrip>><</link>> |<</if>>
		<br>
		올리기/내리기:
		<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked">><<link [[상의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $leftaction to "upper">><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked">><<link [[속상의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $leftaction to "under_upper">><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.lower.name isnot "naked">><<link [[하의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $leftaction to "lower">><</link>> |<</if>>
		<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">><<link [[속하의|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $leftaction to "under_lower">><</link>> |<</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[모든 옷 정리하기|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
	</div>
	<hr>
	<span class="gold">소품:</span><br>
	<div class="small-description">
		<<set _propList to ["haybale", "table", "bench", "milk", "semen", "rails", "neck_shackle", "arm_shackle", "leg_shackle", "breast_pump", "penis_pump", "examtable", "hospitalbed", "ivbag"]>>
		추가:
		<<for _pr1 to 0; _pr1 < _propList.length; _pr1 ++>>
			<<if !$prop.includes(_propList[_pr1])>>
				<<capture _pr1>>
					<<link [[_propList[_pr1]|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<prop _propList[_pr1]>><</link>> |
				<</capture>>
			<</if>>
		<</for>>
		<br>
		제거:
		<<for _pr2 to 0; _pr2 < _propList.length; _pr2 ++>>
			<<if $prop.includes(_propList[_pr2])>>
				<<capture _pr2>>
					<<link [[_propList[_pr2]|Pregnancy Belly Test]]>><<set $prop.delete(_propList[_pr2])>><</link>> |
				<</capture>>
			<</if>>
		<</for>>
	</div>
</label>
<br>
<<link [[집으로 돌아가기|Bedroom]]>><<endcombat>><<unset $bellySizeDebug>><<unset $animDebug>><<clotheson>><</link>>
